# {{name}} · Guide for coding agents

This repository uses a ticket-driven workflow with AI agents.

- **Tickets:** `{{tickets_dir}}/`. The backlog is `{{tickets_dir}}/README.md`.
- **Rules:** `.agents/rules/project.md`. Read it before working.
- **Configuration:** `.agents/workflow.toml` (gates, ticket format, size limits, sensitive surfaces).

## Commands

- `/ticket-new <idea>`: write a ticket.
- `/ticket-run <ID>`: run a ticket end to end.
- `/ticket-review [ID]`: independent review of a ticket or diff.
- `/quality-gate`: run the quality gates and report.
- `/ticket-status [phase]`: state of the backlog.

The single source of these skills, agents and commands is `.agents/`; `.claude/` links to it.
